From a5f26f1ba68e1c285132a5b11d017e46bbdd38c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moto <j3tm0t0@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:37:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] bootwait: tighten the subtitle and title gaps; logo placement
 selectable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Subtitle "Pico Z Loader ･ Raspberry Pi Pico W / x68kzremotedrv" with a
  half-width middle dot (0xA5) and single spaces, re-centred; the full-
  width ・ with three spaces each side left an 8-column hole. Title
  "SMB 接続待ち… (Wi-Fi / SMB を確認してください)" likewise.
- Logo row placement: BW_LOGO=center (default, bootscreen7's optical
  centring) or BW_LOGO=subtitle (left edge on the subtitle's left edge)
  when regenerating bootwait_gen.S; the committed file is "center".
- waiter_test.py: subtitle centred, no wide gaps in subtitle and title,
  placement checked for the selected mode; the screen model decodes
  half-width kana.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PrGdt1XK1exBgERrMmLA1u
---
